<section class="section wrap split" id="move-out-scope"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your move-out checklist</p><h2>More than the<br>visible surfaces.</h2>
<p>Move-out cleaning is planned for an empty house, condo or townhouse. Appliance and cabinet interiors are included in the move-out estimate. We review access, condition and your priorities before agreeing the final written scope.</p>
<p>Share the requirements from your landlord or property manager when you request your clean. We’ll review them with you before confirmation.</p></div>
<div><ul class="check-list"><li>Kitchen counters, sink and accessible surfaces</li><li>Inside the oven and empty fridge, as agreed in your quote</li><li>Inside empty cabinets and drawers</li><li>Bathroom fixtures, mirrors and agreed surfaces</li><li>Reachable baseboards, trim and dusting</li><li>Vacuuming and mopping suitable floors</li></ul>
<p class="quiet">Interior windows, extra pet-hair removal and unusual buildup need to be discussed. Your written quote confirms the work.</p></div></section>

<section class="soft"><div class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">Before we arrive</p><div class="cards">
<article class="card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Clear the space.</h3><p>Remove belongings and rubbish, empty the fridge, and clear cabinets and drawers that need cleaning. Tell us if furniture will remain so we can plan the accessible areas.</p></article>
<article class="card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Plan access.</h3><p>Tell us about parking, building entry and any lift booking. Confirm water and electricity will be available. Agree access arrangements directly with us; keep door and alarm codes out of the request form.</p></article>
<article class="card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Share the deadline.</h3><p>Tell us when movers will finish and when keys are due back. Request a preferred start at least 72 hours ahead. We agree the cleaning window after reviewing the home and cleaner availability.</p></article>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A clear agreement</p><h2>Know what’s planned<br>before handover.</h2></div>
<div><p>Your written quote records the areas and tasks we agree to clean. Raise appliance condition, heavy buildup, delicate surfaces and checklist requirements before accepting it.</p>
<p>If you need completion notes or photos, ask before the visit so we can agree what is recorded and who receives it. A cleaning service cannot guarantee a damage-deposit return or decide a tenancy dispute.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="/quality-reporting/">How we agree on cleaning records</a></div></section>

<section class="section wrap faq-list" aria-label="Move-out cleaning questions"><h2>Before you move.</h2>
<details><summary>Are oven, fridge and cabinet interiors included?</summary><p>They are included in the move-out estimate. The fridge, cabinets and drawers need to be emptied and accessible. Tell us about heavy buildup or unusual condition so the final quote reflects the work.</p></details>
<details><summary>How long does a move-out clean take?</summary><p>Size, bathrooms, condition and the agreed checklist affect the time needed. Share your moving and key handover deadlines. We review the work and cleaner availability before confirming a suitable cleaning window.</p></details>
<details><summary>Where can I request move-out cleaning?</summary><p>We review requests in {{ site.areas }}. Enter the property’s neighbourhood or postal code so we can check coverage and cleaner availability before confirming a date.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can you clean before I move in?</summary><p>You can request a clean for an empty home before moving in. Choose move-out cleaning on the form and tell us it is a move-in request, when you receive access and when belongings will arrive.</p></details>
<details><summary>What happens after I send a request?</summary><p>We review the property details, access, handover deadline and cleaner availability. You review and accept the written quote before we confirm your appointment. Submitting the form does not reserve a time or require payment details.</p></details>
<details><summary>What needs a separate scope?</summary><p>Carpet extraction, heavy lifting, waste removal, hazardous materials, pest contamination, work at height and specialist remediation are outside the general cleaning scope. Tell us about unusual conditions before requesting a date so we can discuss suitability.</p></details>
<details><summary>How is my quote prepared?</summary><p>Your home’s size, bathrooms, condition and checklist determine the work. Review <a href="/pricing/?service=moveout">how we prepare an estimate</a>, then request a written quote for your property.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do I need a move-out clean or a regular clean?</summary><p>Choose move-out cleaning for an empty home around a move. For a home you are living in, see <a href="/residential/">regular and deep residential cleaning</a>.</p></details></section>

